Phasmid: CSS system colors

What:     Every CSS system color keyword a document resolves for the
          profile's color scheme comes from system_colors; the other scheme
          keeps Chromium's set. The GTK or Qt theme and the desktop accent
          color no longer reach renderers; a light profile's SelectedItem and
          SelectedItemText also back the OffscreenCanvas selection colors.
Why:      System colors expose the desktop theme and must agree with the
          claimed OS and color scheme.
Profile:  system_colors.*, display.prefers_color_scheme
Hooks:    third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/layout_theme.cc
          LayoutTheme::SystemColorFromColorProvider;
          chrome/browser/renderer_preferences_util.cc UpdateFromSystemSettings;
          content/browser/theme_helper.cc MakeUpdateSystemColorInfoParams
Contexts: main, iframe; OffscreenCanvas fillStyle in pages and workers keeps
          stock's constant table except the selection colors, as stock does
Guard:    tests/guards/display/system-colors.py

